# OpenSSL <-> PKCS#11 bridge used by `stage sign` (Authenticode via
# osslsigncode).
#   engine   = libp11 engine (ELEBAKE_PKCS11_ENGINE) -- the clean path on
#              FreeBSD: osslsigncode links against BASE OpenSSL, which only
#              searches /usr/lib/ossl-modules for providers.
#   provider = OpenSSL 3 provider (ELEBAKE_PKCS11_PROVIDER, pkg
#              openssl-pkcs11provider); needs OPENSSL_MODULES pointing at the
#              port's module dir, which then HIDES the base legacy provider.
